  <h2>ISO 9001:2026 transition checklist</h2>
  <p>
    None of these steps need to happen before your next audit. They are worth starting now so the transition
    is a series of small updates rather than a scramble in 2029.
  </p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Step</th>
          <th>What it involves</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
